      "parameters": {
        "width": 512,
        "height": 544,
        "content": "## RB2B → Multichannel Outreach (HeyReach + Instantly)\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Triggers capture events either manually, scheduled, or via webhooks. \n2. Data is set and processed through various pathways based on business logic. \n3. Enrichment of data occurs when certain conditions are met. \n4. Depending on the outcome, leads are routed to different services for handling. \n5. The workflow concludes with the data being saved or further processed.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Configure API credentials for FullEnrich service.\n- [ ] Set up HeyReach and Instantly accounts for lead management.\n- [ ] Define the schedule for Schedule Trigger in applicable nodes.\n- [ ] Ensure Webhook endpoints are accessible and properly configured.\n"
